{
  "id": "s1",
  "wireframe": "s1",
  "title": "Tutorial",
  "background": "room-light",
  "note": "The tutorial room. On the first launch the invite with the language choice; in the room, the current lesson at the top and the lesson list at the right, over the MVP round HUD of s7 without the timer, the anger meter, the roster and the role (Hud). After lesson 9 the game returns to the main menu (s2) with no end screen. The nine lessons are the game's (GDD §15: Throwing replaced Delivery in #901); which lessons the MVP adds (points and the workbench, the neighbours' anger and the cops, a task) is open, the engineer's design. Lesson 2 names the battery, an MVP item (a draft; which item lies in the room is the game's data).",
  "states": [
    { "id": "invite", "label": "Запрошення", "note": "First launch only (a user:// flag). Focus starts on Start the tutorial." },
    { "id": "step", "label": "Крок навчання", "note": "Lesson 2, its first instruction: a sentence with one keycap." },
    { "id": "step-keys", "label": "Крок: керування", "note": "Lesson 1 (Controls): a row of keycaps instead of the sentence." },
    { "id": "step-howto", "label": "Крок: «?» на мапі", "note": "Lesson 5, its second instruction: the round «?» keycap inside the sentence. The map (s8) is open in this lesson; it is not drawn here, nor the HUD under its dim." },
    { "id": "step-dead", "label": "Крок: смерть", "note": "Lesson 7 (Death): the player died and waits in the dead's room (m8 §3), so the round HUD is hidden; the dead's room overlay is s9's and is not drawn here. Its two lines are drafts." }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    { "name": "Dim", "type": "Panel", "variation": "ToyBackdrop", "anchors_preset": "full_rect", "states": ["invite"], "note": "Dims the tutorial room behind the invite." },
    {
      "name": "Lang", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwelve", "states": ["invite"], "anchors_preset": "top_right", "offset_left": -39, "offset_top": 39, "offset_right": -39, "offset_bottom": 39, "note": "The two chips share one ButtonGroup. The default is Ukrainian when OS.get_locale_language() is \"uk\", else English. A press applies at once (TranslationServer.set_locale) and is saved; the invite's texts rebuild on NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED.",
      "children": [
        { "name": "Uk", "type": "Button", "variation": "ToyChipToggleOnDark", "key": "lang.uk", "toggle_mode": true, "state": "selected", "note": "A language's name is always in its own language: lang.uk holds the same word in every locale, so the key translates to it." },
        { "name": "En", "type": "Button", "variation": "ToyChipToggleOnDark", "key": "lang.en", "toggle_mode": true, "note": "lang.en holds the same word in every locale." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Box", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyPanelDialog", "states": ["invite"], "anchors_preset": "center", "custom_minimum_size": [1032, 0],
      "children": [
        {
          "name": "V", "type": "VBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyColumnThirtyTwo",
          "children": [
            {
              "name": "Text", "type": "VBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyColumnSixteen",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Title", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyTitleOnLight", "key": "tutorial.invite.title", "horizontal_alignment": "center" },
                { "name": "Body", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyTextMutedOnLight", "key": "tutorial.invite.body", "horizontal_alignment": "center", "autowrap_mode": "word_smart", "custom_minimum_size": [720, 0] }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Buttons", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwentyFour", "alignment": "center",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Start", "type": "Button", "variation": "ToyButtonPrimary", "key": "tutorial.invite.start", "state": "focus", "note": "Focused on open. Starts lesson 1 and hides the invite for good." },
                { "name": "Skip", "type": "Button", "variation": "ToyButtonGhostOnLight", "key": "tutorial.invite.skip", "note": "Goes to the main menu (s2) and hides the invite for good. Esc (ui_cancel) does the same." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hud", "type": "Control", "anchors_preset": "full_rect", "states": ["step", "step-keys"], "note": "Not part of this scene: the MVP round HUD of s7 (s7/Hud) as in a round, without the timer, the anger meter, the roster (the lesson list takes the top right) and the role; Aim shows as in s7. Drawn here only to show what the lesson plates share the screen with: the vitals at the bottom left with the mic beside them, item bar A at the bottom right (both hands empty here), each 39 px in (the sketch's 26 x 1.5; the item bar 51 from the bottom, the sketch's 34, so a name tag clears the edge). Build it once, in s7.",
      "children": [
        { "name": "Cross", "type": "Panel", "variation": "ToyCrosshair", "anchors_preset": "center" },
        {
          "name": "Vitals", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwentyFour", "anchors_preset": "bottom_left", "offset_left": 39, "offset_top": -39, "offset_right": 39, "offset_bottom": -39,
          "children": [
            {
              "name": "Bars", "type": "VBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyColumnTwelve", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_end",
              "children": [
                {
                  "name": "Health", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyBarTrack", "custom_minimum_size": [300, 24],
                  "children": [
                    { "name": "Fill", "type": "ProgressBar", "variation": "ToyBarHealth", "show_percentage": false, "max_value": 1, "value": 1, "custom_minimum_size": [0, 14] }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Stamina", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyBarTrack", "custom_minimum_size": [300, 24],
                  "children": [
                    { "name": "Fill", "type": "ProgressBar", "variation": "ToyBarStamina", "show_percentage": false, "max_value": 1, "value": 1, "custom_minimum_size": [0, 14] }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Mic", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyMic", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_end",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Icon", "type": "TextureRect", "icon": "mic", "theme_color": "icon-on", "custom_minimum_size": [42, 42], "size_flags_horizontal": "shrink_center", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Slots", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowSixteen", "anchors_preset": "bottom_right", "offset_left": -39, "offset_top": -51, "offset_right": -39, "offset_bottom": -51, "note": "Item bar A (the engineer, 2026-10-20): the hand slot (green, 150) and the belt slot (mint, 126), bottoms aligned; an empty slot shows its faint palm or pocket and no name tag.",
          "children": [
            {
              "name": "Hand", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToySlotHand", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_end",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Picture", "type": "TextureRect", "icon": "slot-empty-hand", "custom_minimum_size": [111, 111], "note": "The carried item's pack icon (icons/item-*.svg), else icons/slot-empty-hand.svg; never tinted." }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Belt", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToySlotBelt", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_end",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Picture", "type": "TextureRect", "icon": "slot-empty-belt", "custom_minimum_size": [90, 90], "note": "icons/item-*.svg, else icons/slot-empty-belt.svg; never tinted." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyPlate", "states": ["step", "step-keys", "step-howto", "step-dead"], "anchors_preset": "center_top", "offset_top": 39, "offset_bottom": 39, "custom_minimum_size": [1140, 0], "note": "mouse_filter IGNORE (and its children). The current lesson. A lesson advances when the game sees its action; a lesson with two instructions swaps Title and How within the same step number. The lessons (Progress {count} of 9; the list key; the title key, the how key and the binding that fills {key}): 1 tutorial.list.move: tutorial.step.move.title with the key row HowKeys (control.forward, control.left, control.backward, control.right, control.sprint, control.jump), advancing once the player has moved. 2 tutorial.list.pick_up: tutorial.step.pick_up.title, tutorial.step.pick_up.how, control.interact (E); then tutorial.step.put_down.title, tutorial.step.press, control.put_down (Q). 3 tutorial.list.hand_belt: tutorial.step.hand_belt.title, tutorial.step.press, control.swap (X). 4 tutorial.list.throw: tutorial.step.throw.title, tutorial.step.throw.how, control.throw (G). 5 tutorial.list.map: tutorial.step.map.title, tutorial.step.press, control.map (M); then tutorial.step.howto.title, tutorial.step.howto.how with the round «?» keycap (the map's «?» button). 6 tutorial.list.downed: tutorial.step.downed.title, tutorial.step.downed.how, control.interact held (E). 7 tutorial.list.death: tutorial.step.dead_room.title, tutorial.step.dead_room.how (drafts), no key: the player waits in the dead's room (m8 §3) and comes back at a capsule. 8 tutorial.list.voice: tutorial.step.voice.title, tutorial.step.voice.how, no key. 9 tutorial.list.menu: tutorial.step.menu.title, tutorial.step.press, Esc (ui_cancel, a wide keycap).",
      "children": [
        {
          "name": "V", "type": "VBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyColumnTwelve", "alignment": "center",
          "children": [
            { "name": "Progress", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateTextMuted", "key": "tutorial.step.progress", "args": { "count": "2", "total": "9" }, "horizontal_alignment": "center", "per_state": { "step-keys": { "args": { "count": "1", "total": "9" } }, "step-howto": { "args": { "count": "5", "total": "9" } }, "step-dead": { "args": { "count": "7", "total": "9" } } } },
            { "name": "Title", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateTitle", "key": "tutorial.step.pick_up.title", "horizontal_alignment": "center", "autowrap_mode": "word_smart", "custom_minimum_size": [900, 0], "per_state": { "step-keys": { "key": "tutorial.step.move.title" }, "step-howto": { "key": "tutorial.step.howto.title" }, "step-dead": { "key": "tutorial.step.dead_room.title" } } },
            {
              "name": "How", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwelve", "alignment": "center", "states": ["step", "step-howto"], "note": "A sentence with a keycap (P3), built in code: tr() the lesson's how-string, split it at {key}, strip_edges() each piece, add a Label per non-empty piece and the keycap between them; a how-string without {key} (death, voice) is one Label. The keycap is a ToyKeyOnDark PanelContainer holding a ToyKeyText Label: DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical() of the action's binding (#211); Space and the mouse buttons use key.space, key.mouse_left, key.mouse_right, and Space, Shift, Tab and Esc keycaps take the wide size. Lesson 5's «?» is a ToyKeyRound keycap with the text «?», the look of the map's «?» button.",
              "children": [
                { "name": "Before", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "tutorial.step.pick_up.how", "piece": 0, "args": { "key": "E" }, "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center", "per_state": { "step-howto": { "key": "tutorial.step.howto.how", "args": { "key": "?" } } } },
                {
                  "name": "Key", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark", "per_state": { "step-howto": { "variation": "ToyKeyRound" } },
                  "children": [
                    { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "key": "tutorial.step.pick_up.how", "value_of": "key", "args": { "key": "E" }, "horizontal_alignment": "center", "per_state": { "step-howto": { "key": "tutorial.step.howto.how", "args": { "key": "?" } } } }
                  ]
                },
                { "name": "After", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "tutorial.step.howto.how", "piece": 1, "args": { "key": "?" }, "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center", "states": ["step-howto"] }
              ]
            },
            { "name": "HowText", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "tutorial.step.dead_room.how", "horizontal_alignment": "center", "states": ["step-dead"], "note": "A how-string without {key}: one Label (voice's works the same)." },
            {
              "name": "HowKeys", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowThirtyTwo", "alignment": "center", "states": ["step-keys"], "note": "The Controls lesson: the bound keys of walking, sprinting and jumping, each group followed by its action name; it advances once the player has moved. Each keycap shows the label of its action's binding as a data text (DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(), #211; auto_translate_mode DISABLED); Space is key.space. Shift and Space keycaps take the wide size.",
              "children": [
                {
                  "name": "Walk", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwelve",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "name": "Keys", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowEight",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "name": "Forward", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark",
                          "children": [
                            { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "text": "W", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "name": "Left", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark",
                          "children": [
                            { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "text": "A", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "name": "Backward", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark",
                          "children": [
                            { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "text": "S", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "name": "Right", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark",
                          "children": [
                            { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "text": "D", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    { "name": "Label", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "control.walk", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Sprint", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwelve",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "name": "Key", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark", "wide": true,
                      "children": [
                        { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "text": "Shift", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                      ]
                    },
                    { "name": "Label", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "control.sprint", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "Jump", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowTwelve",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "name": "Key", "type": "PanelContainer", "variation": "ToyKeyOnDark", "wide": true,
                      "children": [
                        { "name": "Text", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyKeyText", "key": "key.space", "horizontal_alignment": "center" }
                      ]
                    },
                    { "name": "Label", "type": "Label", "variation": "ToyPlateText", "key": "control.jump", "size_flags_vertical": "shrink_center" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
